alse, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOHy0Bzc6AqEKN", "number": 14048, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14048.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14048", "merged_at": "2024-11-01T19:23:18Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14048.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/pulls/14048"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14048/reactions"}, "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff", "score": 1.0, "state": "closed", "state_reason": null, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14048/timeline", "title": "[red-knot] Infer type of if-expression if test has statically known truthiness", "type": null, "updated_at": "2024-11-01T20:11:22Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14048", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13377822?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/TomerBin", "id": 13377822, "login": "TomerBin", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzc3ODIy", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin", "user_view_type": "public"}}, {"active_lock_reason": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR enables red-knot to support type narrowing based on `and` and `or` conditionals, including nested combinations and their negation (for `elif` / `else` blocks and for `not` operator). Part of #13694.\r\n\r\nIn order to address this properly (hopefully \ud83d\ude05), I had to run `NarrowingConstraintsBuilder` functions recursively. In the first commit I introduced a minor refactor - instead of mutating `self.constraints`, the new constraints are now returned as function return values. I also modified the constraints map to be optional, preventing unnecessary hashmap allocations.\r\nThanks @carljm for your support on this :)\r\n\r\nThe second commit contains the logic and tests for handling boolean ops, with improvements to intersections handling in `is_subtype_of` .\r\n\r\nAs I'm still new to Rust and the internals of type checkers, I\u2019d be more than happy to hear any insights or suggestions.\r\nThank you!", "closed_at": "2024-11-04T22:54:35Z", "comments": 3, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14037/comments", "created_at": "2024-11-01T11:14:26Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14037/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14037", "id": 2628836436, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [{"archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "color": "46EBE1", "default": false, "description": "The ty type checker", "id": 7024288340, "name": "ty", "node_id": "LA_kwDOHy0Bzc8AAAABoq4iVA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/labels/ty"}], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14037/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOHy0Bzc6AnvuQ", "number": 14037, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14037.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14037", "merged_at": "2024-11-04T22:54:35Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/14037.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/pulls/14037"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14037/reactions"}, "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff", "score": 1.0, "state": "closed", "state_reason": null, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14037/timeline", "title": "[red-knot] Implement type narrowing for boolean conditionals", "type": null, "updated_at": "2024-11-04T23:03:50Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/14037", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13377822?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/TomerBin", "id": 13377822, "login": "TomerBin", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzc3ODIy", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin", "user_view_type": "public"}}, {"active_lock_reason": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds type narrowing in `and` and `or` expressions, for example:\r\n\r\n```py\r\nclass A: ...\r\n\r\nx: A | None = A() if bool_instance() else None\r\n\r\nisinstance(x, A) or reveal_type(x)  # revealed: None\r\n``` \r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\nNew mdtests \ud83d\ude0d \r\n\r\n<!-- How was it tested? -->\r\n", "closed_at": "2024-10-29T01:17:48Z", "comments": 1, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13970/comments", "created_at": "2024-10-28T21:29:04Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13970/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13970", "id": 2619594691, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [{"archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "color": "46EBE1", "default": false, "description": "The ty type checker", "id": 7024288340, "name": "ty", "node_id": "LA_kwDOHy0Bzc8AAAABoq4iVA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/labels/ty"}], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13970/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOHy0Bzc6AKT6D", "number": 13970, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13970.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13970", "merged_at": "2024-10-29T01:17:48Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13970.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/pulls/13970"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13970/reactions"}, "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff", "score": 1.0, "state": "closed", "state_reason": null, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13970/timeline", "title": "[red-knot] Type narrowing inside boolean expressions ", "type": null, "updated_at": "2024-10-29T08:22:32Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13970", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13377822?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/TomerBin", "id": 13377822, "login": "TomerBin", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzc3ODIy", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin", "user_view_type": "public"}}, {"active_lock_reason": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nAfter #13918 has landed, narrowing constraint negation became easy, so adding support for `not` operator.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nI added a new mdtest file for `not` expression, but maybe we should spread it over the other test files (by adding `not` cases to each one of them)? I'll be happy to hear your preference around that :)\r\n\r\n\r\n", "closed_at": "2024-10-28T20:27:27Z", "comments": 2, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13942/comments", "created_at": "2024-10-27T20:32:08Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13942/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13942", "id": 2616847830, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [{"archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "color": "46EBE1", "default": false, "description": "The ty type checker", "id": 7024288340, "name": "ty", "node_id": "LA_kwDOHy0Bzc8AAAABoq4iVA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/labels/ty"}], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13942/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOHy0Bzc6ABeQB", "number": 13942, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13942.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13942", "merged_at": "2024-10-28T20:27:27Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13942.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/pulls/13942"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13942/reactions"}, "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff", "score": 1.0, "state": "closed", "state_reason": null, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13942/timeline", "title": "[red-knot] Narrowing - Not operator ", "type": null, "updated_at": "2024-10-28T20:49:18Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13942", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13377822?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/TomerBin", "id": 13377822, "login": "TomerBin", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzc3ODIy", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/TomerBin", "user_view_type": "public"}}, {"active_lock_reason": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nAs python uses short-circuiting boolean operations in runtime, we should mimic that logic in redknot as well.\r\nFor example, we should detect that in the following code `x` might be undefined inside the block:\r\n\r\n```py\r\nif flag or (x := 1):\r\n    print(x) \r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nAdded mdtest suit for boolean expressions. \r\n", "closed_at": "2024-10-27T03:33:02Z", "comments": 1, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13940/comments", "created_at": "2024-10-26T19:28:20Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13940/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13940", "id": 2616097043, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [{"archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "color": "46EBE1", "default": false, "description": "The ty type checker", "id": 7024288340, "name": "ty", "node_id": "LA_kwDOHy0Bzc8AAAABoq4iVA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/labels/ty"}], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/issues/13940/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOHy0Bzc5__wdL", "number": 13940, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13940.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13940", "merged_at": "2024-10-27T03:33:02Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/13940.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/ruff/pulls/13940"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.g